cff-version: 1.2.0
title: scPerturb-CMap
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2025-09-27
authors:
  - family-names: Lee
    given-names: James Hyojae
    email: james.hyojae.lee@gmail.com
abstract: >-
  scPerturb-CMap links single-cell disease signatures to experimentally
  profiled perturbations in the Connectivity Map (LINCS L1000) to speed drug
  repurposing analyses. Cite this software when you build on its CLI, API,
  or metric-learning components in your work.
repository-code: https://github.com/jameslee/scPerturb-CMap
license: MIT
keywords:
  - single-cell
  - connectivity mapping
  - drug repurposing
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.1234567
